{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI exposes a collection of values to your app’s views in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentValues"},{"type":"text","text":" structure. To read a value from the structure,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declare a property using the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property wrapper and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specify the value’s key path. For example, you can read the current locale:"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DynamicProperty","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI17EnvironmentValuesV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnvironmentValues","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"EnvironmentValues","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EnvironmentValues","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnvironmentValues","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":[